Epoch_2b_childWithdraw
├── given the active strategy is remote on Child
├── and a depositor has claimed Yieldcoin shares from a prior epoch
├── and the epoch has net withdrawals
├── when CRE closes the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch executing
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── when CRE executes the withdraw through Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should bridge withdrawn USDC back to Parent
├── and ParentVault should become claimable after local CCIP delivery
└── and the withdrawer should claim USDC while shares are burned
